			"widgets_values":[
				"\"Create a 12-panel storyboard in black and white ink sketch style. Each panel should depict scenes featuring a Toyota Sienna car in various settings, maintaining high contrast and dynamic comic book line art style. Use pure black, white, and gray shading. Arrange the storyboard in a 3x4 grid format. \n\n1. Panel 1: Show a close-up of the front of the Toyota Sienna with a cityscape in the blurred background. Sunlight reflects off the car's logo.  \n2. Panel 2: Depict the Sienna driving through a bustling urban street, surrounded by tall buildings reflecting sunlight.  \n3. Panel 3: Show the car crossing a bridge with a river and the city skyline visible in the distance.  \n4. Panel 4: Illustrate the Sienna navigating a winding mountain road, surrounded by trees.  \n5. Panel 5: Close-up of the car's wheels driving through a muddy path, emphasizing its strong grip.  \n6. Panel 6: Sienna driving through a rainy scene, raindrops sliding off the windows, headlights glowing in the rain.  \n7. Panel 7: Interior view of the car with a happy family enjoying the ride, smiling and talking.  \n8. Panel 8: Show the open trunk of the Sienna, packed with various luggage, showcasing its spaciousness.  \n9. Panel 9: Illustrate the car driving through a desert landscape, kicking up dust behind it.  \n10. Panel 10: Sienna parked atop a mountain, surrounded by nature, with a beautiful sunset in the background.  \n11. Panel 11: Sienna driving through a vibrant city at night, neon lights reflecting off the car's exterior.  \n12. Panel 12: Close-up of the Toyota Sienna logo on a white background with the tagline 'Sienna, Drive Your Life' written below in bold.\""
			],
