			"widgets_values":[
				"### 第一部分：创意内容描述 (Creative Content Brief)\n\n| 标题 | 内容 |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **项目名称** | 塞纳汽车广告分镜 |\n| **分镜总格数** | 12格 (3x4) |\n| **总体风格** | 黑白、高对比度、手绘线稿 |\n\n**【分镜图内容列表 (Shot List)】**\n\n| 编号 | 画面描述 (Visual/Action) | 镜头/景别 (Shot Type) | 旁白/对话/文字 (Narration/Text) |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 1 | 城市的清晨，太阳刚刚升起，街道空旷，远处隐隐约约出现塞纳汽车的轮廓。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | “当一天开始……” |\n| 2 | 塞纳汽车驶过繁忙的城市街道，高楼林立，车流穿梭。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | “塞纳与你同行，穿越城市喧嚣。” |\n| 3 | 塞纳汽车驶过一座现代化桥梁，阳光反射在车身上，显得格外耀眼。 | 仰角镜头 (Low Angle Shot) | |\n| 4 | 夜晚城市灯火通明，塞纳汽车灯光明亮，行驶在霓虹灯下的街道。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | |\n| 5 | 塞纳汽车驶入郊外，周围是郁郁葱葱的树林和蜿蜒的道路。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | “无论何处，塞纳都能带你去。” |\n| 6 | 汽车穿越小溪，水花四溅，展示其强大的越野性能。 | 高角度俯视镜头 (Bird’s Eye View) | |\n| 7 | 塞纳汽车在山间盘旋，远处是宏伟的山脉和蓝天白云。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | |\n| 8 | 车内镜头，家庭温馨的场景，孩子们在后座玩耍，父母微笑驾驶。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | “舒适空间，陪伴每一段旅程。” |\n| 9 | 塞纳汽车停车在湖边，车主在后备箱拿出野餐篮，准备享受自然。 | 中景 (Medium Shot) | |\n| 10 | 家庭在湖边野餐，塞纳汽车停在旁边，展现其宽敞的后备箱空间。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | |\n| 11 | 汽车行驶在夕阳下的平原，背景是金色的麦田和蓝天。 | 全景 (Wide Shot) | “探索无限可能。” |\n| 12 | 塞纳汽车停在城市街道，一家人微笑站在车旁，车后出现品牌Logo和标语。 | 特写 (Close-up) | “塞纳，让每一段旅程更美好。” |\n\n---\n\n### 第二部分：生成的黑白分镜图 (Generated Storyboard)\n\n**【提示生成指令 (Prompt for Image Generation)】**\n\nGenerate a 12-panel storyboard in a **3x4 grid layout**, using **black and white hand-drawn sketch style**. The storyboard should feature a Toyota Sienna car in various scenes, showcasing its versatility in urban and outdoor environments. Follow these detailed panel instructions:\n\n1. **Panel 1**: A wide shot of a modern city street at dawn, with the silhouette of the Toyota Sienna emerging in the distance. High contrast black and white, cinematic lighting.\n2. **Panel 2**: Medium shot of the Toyota Sienna driving through a busy city street, surrounded by tall skyscrapers and moving traffic. Dynamic lines to show motion.\n3. **Panel 3**: Low angle shot of the Sienna crossing a modern bridge, sunlight reflecting off its sleek body. Include architectural details in the background.\n4. **Panel 4**: Wide shot of the Sienna driving through a neon-lit street at night, headlights illuminating the road. Vibrant light reflections in black and white tones.\n5. **Panel 5**: Medium shot of the Sienna entering a lush forest, surrounded by trees and a winding road. Add texture to the leaves and road.\n6. **Panel 6**: Bird’s eye view of the Sienna crossing a shallow stream, water splashing dynamically around the wheels. Highlight the car’s sturdy design.\n7. **Panel 7**: Wide shot of the Sienna on a mountain road, with grand mountain peaks in the background and a clear sky.\n8. **Panel 8**: Medium shot inside the car, showing a family with joyful expressions. Children playing in the backseat while the parents look happy in the front seats.\n9. **Panel 9**: Medium shot of the Sienna parked by a serene lakeside, with a person opening the rear trunk to retrieve a picnic basket.\n10. **Panel 10**: Wide shot of the family enjoying a picnic by the lake, with the Sienna parked nearby. The rear trunk is open, showing its spaciousness.\n11. **Panel 11**: Wide shot of the Sienna driving across a golden sunset-lit field, surrounded by a vast expanse of wheat and a clear sky above.\n12. **Panel 12**: Close-up shot of the Sienna parked on a modern urban street, with a family standing by the car and smiling. The Toyota logo and slogan “塞纳，让每一段旅程更美好” displayed prominently in the background.\n\nEnsure all panels are consistent with **high-contrast black and white ink sketch style**, with dynamic lines and cinematic composition."
